Track N part 2 — evidence-gated accent vividness. REJECTED; kept so the calibration is
reproducible.

1. `policy.ts`, inside `identity`:

		/** Calibrated on 12 decisive verdicts (batches 17-18): the seven vivid-preferred rivals
		 *  carry 8, 8, 11, 15, 16, 24, 24 qualifying mark components; four of the five
		 *  incumbent-preferred carry 0, 2, 3, 6. Above `mark.minimumComponentCount` (3) on
		 *  purpose: three strokes make a mark candidate, eight make a substantial element. */
		accentVividnessMarkComponents: 8,
		/** Where the vividness credit saturates. Above identityDirectionFullChroma (0.09)
